<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Portofolio — Foura Creative</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="cat-head">
  <div class="eyebrow">PORTOFOLIO</div>
  <h1>Contoh gaya konten yang kami tawarkan.</h1>
  <p>Berikut gambaran jenis konten yang akan Anda dapatkan saat bekerja sama dengan Foura Creative.</p>
</div>

<div class="catalog-title">Contoh Konten Feed Instagram</div>
<div class="portfolio-grid">
  <div class="portfolio-card">
    <div class="portfolio-thumb"><img src="/images/feed-instagram2.jpg" alt="Contoh konten promosi produk"></div>
    <div class="portfolio-info"><p>Konten promosi yang menonjolkan detail produk, material, dan karakter fashion brand.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="portfolio-card">
    <div class="portfolio-thumb"><img src="/images/feed-instagram.jpg" alt="Contoh konten edukatif"></div>
    <div class="portfolio-info"><p>Konten edukatif seputar styling, tips fashion, dan inspirasi outfit untuk audiens.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="portfolio-card">
    <div class="portfolio-thumb"><img src="/images/feed-instagram3.jpg" alt="Contoh konten promo musiman"></div>
    <div class="portfolio-info"><p>Konten promosi dan seasonal campaign yang dirancang untuk meningkatkan engagement dan daya tarik produk.</p></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="catalog-title">Contoh Konten Video TikTok</div>
<div class="portfolio-grid">
  <div class="portfolio-card">
    <div class="portfolio-thumb" style="aspect-ratio:16/9;"><img src="/images/portofolio-tiktok.jpg" alt="Contoh video behind the scenes"></div>
    <div class="portfolio-info"><p>Konten styling outfit yang menampilkan cara mix & match produk secara effortless.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="portfolio-card">
    <div class="portfolio-thumb" style="aspect-ratio:16/9;"><img src="/images/portofolio-tiktok2.jpg" alt="Contoh video review testimoni"></div>
    <div class="portfolio-info"><p>Konten storytelling dan review produk untuk membangun ketertarikan serta kepercayaan audiens.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="portfolio-card">
    <div class="portfolio-thumb" style="aspect-ratio:16/9;"><img src="/images/portofolio-tiktok3.jpg" alt="Contoh video trend challenge"></div>
    <div class="portfolio-info"><p>Konten trend dan challenge yang dikemas sesuai dengan karakter visual dan identitas brand.</p></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="content-plan">
  <div class="content-plan-head">
    <div class="eyebrow">CONTOH CONTENT PLAN</div>
    <h3>Strategi Konten yang Terarah dan Sesuai Karakter Brand.</h3>
    <p>Rencana konten yang disusun berdasarkan tujuan komunikasi dan karakter brand, agar pesan lebih efektif dan konsisten di setiap platform.</p>
    <div class="divider"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="cp-steps">
    <div class="cp-step">
      <div class="cp-num">01</div>
      <div class="cp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.59 13.41 13.42 20.58a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0L2 12V2h10l8.59 8.59a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.82Z"/><line x1="7" y1="7" x2="7.01" y2="7"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Product Highlight</h4>
      <p>Menampilkan produk unggulan dengan visual menarik dan informasi singkat.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cp-step">
      <div class="cp-num">02</div>
      <div class="cp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2Z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7Z"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Educational Content</h4>
      <p>Tips fashion, styling, mix & match, atau informasi relevan dengan audiens.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cp-step">
      <div class="cp-num">03</div>
      <div class="cp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78Z"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Brand Storytelling</h4>
      <p>Membangun cerita dan karakter brand melalui konten yang lebih personal dan relatable.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cp-step">
      <div class="cp-num">04</div>
      <div class="cp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Promotional Content</h4>
      <p>Konten promo, diskon, launching, atau campaign untuk mendorong minat beli.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cp-step">
      <div class="cp-num">05</div>
      <div class="cp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5Z"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Engagement Content</h4>
      <p>Konten interaktif seperti Q&A, polling, atau kuis yang mendorong audiens terlibat.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cp-step">
      <div class="cp-num">06</div>
      <div class="cp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="3"/><line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="23"/><line x1="4.22" y1="4.22" x2="5.64" y2="5.64"/><line x1="18.36" y1="18.36" x2="19.78" y2="19.78"/><line x1="1" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"/><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12"/><line x1="4.22" y1="19.78" x2="5.64" y2="18.36"/><line x1="18.36" y1="5.64" x2="19.78" y2="4.22"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Seasonal / Campaign</h4>
      <p>Konten yang disesuaikan dengan momen tertentu, tren fashion, atau campaign brand.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>